{
  "name": "PRAX — Personal AI Execution Agent V2",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚙️ PRAX V2 — Setup Required\n\n### Step 1: Create Reminders Table\nGo to **Data → Create Data Table** called `PRAX Reminders`\nAdd columns:\n- `reminder_id` (text)\n- `chat_id` (text)\n- `reminder_text` (text)\n- `remind_at` (dateTime)\n- `status` (text)\n- `created_at` (dateTime)\n\n### Step 2: Find & Replace\n- `REPLACE_REMINDERS_TABLE_ID` → ID of your Reminders table\n- `REPLACE_YOUR_CHAT_ID` → Your Telegram chat ID\n\n### Step 3: Verify Cron Times\n- Morning briefing: 7:30 AM IST → `0 2 * * *` UTC\n- Reminder check: every 15 min → `*/15 * * * *`\n- Evening review: 11:00 PM IST → `30 17 * * *` UTC\n\nAdjust if your n8n server uses a different timezone.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "aa000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "name": "Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-520, -60]
    },
